<programme channel="DocuBox.HD.fr" start="20261111082000 +0000" stop="20261111085000 +0000">
    <title lang="fr">Nature's Force</title>
    <desc lang="fr">Journey inside Dust Storms to see how they are formed and the hazards and effects they cause. A glimpse into the science of Clouds and how they fit into the weather cycle of the planet. The power of Lightening is more than visual, it is noise, electricity and it even helps plants to grow. Did you know that Rain droplets have different shapes and temperatures, it's maybe more interesting than you think?</desc>
