    <title lang="fr">Afrique : à la vie, à la mort</title>
    <sub-title lang="fr">La force du nombre</sub-title>
    <desc lang="fr">Killer armies collaborate to take down larger prey. On land, a zebra's kick can kill, but in the water it's easy meat for a congregation of crocodiles. Wild dogs may not seem like fearsome predators, but a pack kills fast, brutally and often.</desc>
